fixtures/tests/fixtures/transpiler/top.scs spectre x1, x2, m1 now IR (x2 written with parentheses, f1 after them as the writer orders components); were raw lines
fixtures/tests/fixtures/transpiler/top.scs cdl the IR above holds x1, x2, m1 (leaf and nch_mod from lib.scs), no raw lines, so the xschem layout lists them
fixtures/tests/fixtures/transpiler/top.scs verilog the IR above holds x1, x2, m1 (leaf and nch_mod from lib.scs), no raw lines, so the xschem layout lists them
